sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as Master
    participant B as MQTT broker
    participant C as Client
    participant N as Nav2 + Gazebo

    C->>B: connection: ONLINE (retained)
    M->>B: subscribe state, connection
    B->>M: connection: ONLINE

    M->>B: order (n1 → n8, pick at n4, drop at n8)
    B->>C: order
    C->>B: state: orderId set, pick-1 WAITING, drop-1 WAITING
    B->>M: state → "order accepted"

    loop n1, n2, n3, n4
        C->>N: NavigateToPose(node)
        N-->>C: SUCCEEDED
        C->>B: state: lastNodeId = node
        B->>M: state → "reached node"
    end

    Note over C: At n4 (PickupStation): stop, mock pick for 2 s
    C->>B: state: driving=false, pick-1 RUNNING
    C->>B: state: pick-1 FINISHED
    B->>M: state → "pick-1 FINISHED"

    loop n5, n6, n7, n8
        C->>N: NavigateToPose(node)
        N-->>C: SUCCEEDED
        C->>B: state: lastNodeId = node
    end

    Note over C: At n8 (DropoffStation): stop, mock drop for 2 s
    C->>B: state: drop-1 RUNNING
    C->>B: state: drop-1 FINISHED, nodeStates empty
    B->>M: state → "order COMPLETE"
